# Fastlane + release toolchain — kept locally for development, NOT published.
# fastlane/ holds the App Store Connect AuthKey .p8 and account identifiers, so
# the whole release toolchain is gitignored (release tooling is not part of the
# public client). Run release lanes locally; they are intentionally absent from
# the published repo.
/fastlane/
/Gemfile
/Gemfile.lock
/Scripts/fastlane-*.sh
vendor/bundle
Secrets.xcconfig.bak

# Internal planning / design scratch docs — kept locally, NOT published.
# These are working notes on in-progress architecture (including proprietary
# backend internals) and are not part of the public client. One slipped in
# once (PLAN_NSE_ENHANCE.md); this rule prevents a recurrence.
PLAN_*.md
# ...and their companion evidence DIRECTORIES (`PLAN_<NAME>/` — vet briefs, agent
# reports, measurement dumps). `PLAN_*.md` does NOT match a directory, so
# `PLAN_FOLDER_EPOCH_BOOTSTRAP/` sat untracked-but-publishable until 2026-08-07.
PLAN_*/

# Agent/automation tooling is private infrastructure — never in the public repo.
AGENTS.md
.agents/
.codex/

# v3 refactor recon + vet evidence — internal design notes, same class as PLAN_*.md above.
analysis/v3-recon/
scratchpad/*

# Local build/test scratch — logs, .xcresult bundles, .bak files. Never committed.
scratchpad/
